    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Channel your 4 corners and start aiming \u2014 it's time to fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Squares is a fast-paced, online 2D shooter with 8-directional chaos and colorful, corner-fueled mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your square:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your weapons</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your color</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Square up with your own custom shape</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tumble. Bounce. Recoil. DOMINATE.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine 2 unique classes, each tailored to different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your class isn't just a loadout \u2014 it's your style, your skill, your statement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crave raw power and explosive destruction? Grenade. Rocket Launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed and a thirst for chaos? Charge. Shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to fly and wreak havoc mid-air? Mini-gun. Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about precision and proving it's not a skill issue? Revolver. Sniper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match classes to find the combo that fits your twisted, square-shaped soul. <br>Discover your perfect setup, and shatter the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Infinite combos. Zero mercy. <br>Are you the square to rule them all?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Channel your 4 corners and start aiming \u2014 it's time to fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Squares is a fast-paced, online 2D shooter with 8-directional chaos and colorful, corner-fueled mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your square:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your weapons</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your color</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Square up with your own custom shape</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tumble. Bounce. Recoil. DOMINATE.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine 2 unique classes, each tailored to different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your class isn't just a loadout \u2014 it's your style, your skill, your statement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crave raw power and explosive destruction? Grenade. Rocket Launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed and a thirst for chaos? Charge. Shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to fly and wreak havoc mid-air? Mini-gun. Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about precision and proving it's not a skill issue? Revolver. Sniper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match classes to find the combo that fits your twisted, square-shaped soul. <br>Discover your perfect setup, and shatter the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Infinite combos. Zero mercy. <br>Are you the square to rule them all?</p>",
